OL,3,GNEWSALodger who killed grandfather
OL,4,Agiven hospital order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed a grandfather he was
OL,7,Flodging with 179 times with a kitchen
OL,8,Fknife told paramedics afterwards he was
OL,9,Fa "monster", a court has heard.
OL,11,FMoses Fernandes called an ambulance and
OL,12,Ftold a friend he thought Terry McFadyen
OL,13,Fhad poisoned him, before killing the
OL,14,F71-year-old at the home in Norwich less
OL,15,Fthan an hour later.
OL,17,FExperts concluded the 23-year-old was
OL,18,Fsuffering from a psychotic episode
OL,19,Fcaused by a schizophrenia-like disorder
OL,20,Fand he was sentenced at Norwich Crown
OL,21,FCourt to an indefinite hospital order.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
